sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant R as Redis

    C->>GW: POST /api/resource<br/>Header: X-API-Key: pk_free_xyz
    GW->>GW: resolve rule<br/>(plan: free → 100 req/min)
    GW->>RL: checkLimit(key=pk_free_xyz, rule=free)
    RL->>R: EVAL lua_script<br/>INCR rate:pk_free_xyz:bucket
    R-->>RL: count=101, allowed=false
    RL-->>GW: {allowed: false, retry_after: 37}
    Note over GW: Backend NOT called — saves capacity
    GW-->>C: 429 Too Many Requests<br/>Retry-After: 37<br/>X-RateLimit-Remaining: 0
